sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant L as Tool log
    participant B as Background model
    participant C as Code checks
    actor H as A person
    participant X as Toolbox entry
    participant A as Ada, next request
    L->>B: refused calls, requests asked twice, requests that went to the wrong tool
    B->>C: proposal: a note, an example, a "Not for" line (citing calls)
    C->>C: enough evidence? any copied values? a real neighbour? bounded?
    C->>C: builds the example call itself, digits masked
    C-->>H: revision waits, with its evidence
    H->>X: approve (name recorded)
    X->>X: re-embed with the examples, re-measure ranks
    Note over X,A: After lunch
    X-->>A: docstring + "Learned from use" (notes, never a user's wording)
    A->>A: right tool, right arguments, first call
